WEBVTT

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.400
-Morning!
-Good morning!

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:06.940
-Morning!
-Good morning!

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:10.200
I haven't seen you around.
Are you new to Anatae?

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:11.470
What's your name?

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.770
Nina.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.980
The days when men bow to gods

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.550
are over.

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:20.580
Maybe I'll try catching this guy.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.950
Stop!

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:04.490
Good morning.

00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:14.800
Oh my God!

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:16.370
Don't worry.

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.640
This is my assistant, Rocky.

00:01:18.770 --> 00:01:19.810
Rocky?

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:22.810
I'm Rita. Doctor Rita.

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:24.410
Doctor?

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:25.580
Yes.

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:29.450
Despite how I look, I'm much older than you are.

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:30.620
Really?

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:32.420
Really. Because I'm a zombie.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.430
Enough about me.

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:42.760
Is it true that you transformed into a dragon
and rampaged through the city?

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:45.830
You don't remember?

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:55.380
I guess I did it again.

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:59.350
You blacked out after that and were brought here.

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:01.380
Who carried me here?

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:04.090
-Azazel.
-Who's that?

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:06.790
Maybe you know him as the rag demon.

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:09.320
Rag demon?

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:12.590
Oh, right! I was trying to catch the rag demon!

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:15.760
Anyway, are you even human?

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:17.530
What?

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.640
Or are you a dragon?

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:41.960
If we had that girl's power...

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:10.150
RAGE OF BAHAMUT

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:25.530
DRAGON'S VILLAGE

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:42.780
How are you, Mom?

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:43.950
Stop!

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:48.720
I'm still staying with the god Bacchus in his carriage.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:49.980
Stop it!

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:52.490
His home is very comfortable,

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:56.520
and he treats me very well.

00:04:56.660 --> 00:05:00.060
You're still here? You idiot!

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:11.270
His pet bird is very cute too.

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:13.210
I've also found work.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.610
It's perfect for a girl like me.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.650
Everyone compliments me,

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:21.850
and that makes me want to work hard.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:25.090
Nina! Mind giving me a hand too?

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:27.020
Okay!

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.060
Compared to our village,

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.700
the capital is incredibly lively.

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:42.740
There are so many kind people here.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:43.970
Thanks!

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:55.680
My only worry is that...

00:05:55.820 --> 00:06:00.860
...compared to our village, there are
so many young men in the capital.

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:08.600
But I'm totally fine!

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:11.670
You don't need to worry about me.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:15.300
I'll send back money once I've earned enough.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:18.310
I'm having a good time here.

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:24.880
Thwarted by the sudden appearance of a dragon,

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.680
you let the rag demon escape?

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:28.850
Yes, My Lord.

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:33.150
I hear the dragon was quite the handful.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.590
I would have liked to have seen that.

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:40.660
I believe that I told you

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.200
not to disappoint me.

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:45.330
Apologies, My Lord.

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:54.980
I am relieving the Orleans Knights of their mission
to hunt the rag demon.

00:06:55.940 --> 00:07:00.380
The mission will be reassigned to the Onyx Soldiers.

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:07.660
You are dismissed.

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:22.870
Have Kaisar Lidfard followed.

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:25.010
As you command.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.270
Captain!

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:29.680
Why did you not ask His Highness
for another chance?

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:35.350
Especially after we tarnished the Orleans Knights' name
by holding demons hostage to comply with their plan.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:37.650
Are we just going to give up?

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:42.090
It does not change the fact that we have let
the rag demon slip away on multiple occasions.

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:43.290
But, Captain!

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:45.390
Alessand!

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.340
I've been waiting for you.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:14.260
Pardon me, coming through.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:15.990
Hey, stop right there.

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.830
Do you not remember me?

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.900
What?

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.340
Join me.

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:31.710
Huh?

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:34.440
Join forces with me!

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:38.980
Stop it!

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:41.420
Your power is a threat to the humans.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.950
I have no idea what you're talking about!

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:46.090
If you're a demon,

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:50.020
do you not resent the humans of this city as well?

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:51.490
I don't know what you mean!

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.130
I will educate you then.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.300
Follow me.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:06.140
Come on, follow me!

00:09:06.940 --> 00:09:08.210
Okay.

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:18.250
The humans used to dread the demons.

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:21.060
And in order to fight their fears,

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:23.820
mankind turned to worshipping the gods.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.130
Do you hate humans?

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:29.030
Yes, I hate them!

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:34.240
Demons have been made their slaves now.

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:39.270
It's all that man's doing.

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:41.210
That man?

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:43.080
Charioce XVII.

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:47.920
He brought humans the power
to vanquish the demons.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:51.150
5 YEARS AGO

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:53.120
DEMONS' CAPITAL
COCYTUS

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:05.930
Charioce XVII razed
the demons' capital, Cocytus,

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:12.510
abducted many demons from their homes,
and enslaved them.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:17.340
This prosperity built on the backs of demons

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:19.350
is something I cannot bear!

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:26.250
Oh, no!

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:30.120
Let go of it!

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:32.560
I found it!

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:34.060
No!

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:35.360
Stop it!

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:39.130
It's mine! It's mine!

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:42.040
Let go!

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:46.410
This never happened in my village.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.990
The humans stripped him of his wings

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:03.960
and crushed his windpipe.

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:11.400
I found Mugaro being sold into slavery.

00:11:14.030 --> 00:11:17.370
In order to restore these fallen demons to their rightful place,

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:21.310
I need the power to lay waste
to the foundations of everything in existence.

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:23.440
And you have that power!

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:25.450
But I don't!

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:28.120
Don't lie! I saw it with my own eyes!

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:32.520
You turned into a dragon and made those humans
cower! You are what I need!

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:36.090
Stop it! I don't want to turn into a dragon anymore!

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:37.320
Let me go!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:40.460
Shut up! If you have demon blood
running through your veins,

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:43.660
then use your power for us!

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.100
No! I don't even understand!

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:48.600
-Make yourself understand!
-I can't!

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:50.500
Why don't you do it on your own!

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.170
It has to be you!

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:00.050
But why?

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:02.680
You're the rag demon, aren't you?!

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:05.650
Shut up, just do as I-

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.200
Rita!

00:12:18.430 --> 00:12:22.170
I thought you were a rag demon, not a nag demon.

00:12:23.170 --> 00:12:24.340
Stupid little zombie girl.

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:26.710
Shouldn't you be going off to work soon?

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:28.240
Hurry up and go.

00:12:30.410 --> 00:12:32.280
I'm not giving up.

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:34.210
Let's go.

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:49.060
RAGE OF BAHAMUT

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:22.620
How are you, Mom?

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:29.060
I saw some miserable-looking demons
in the capital today.

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:34.600
It seems here are a lot of things in
the capital that I don't know about.

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:36.370
Some weird black demon...

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:39.270
told me I was a demon too.

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:44.180
If you have demon blood running through
your veins, then use your power for us!

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:55.190
Just like you asked, I haven't told anyone the
secret of what makes me turn into a dragon.

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:57.290
But...

00:14:58.190 --> 00:15:00.390
Humans and demons...

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:03.200
I really don't understand.

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:04.800
Oh, well!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:07.230
Time for some shut-eye!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:57.250
Don't!

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:02.920
Please!

00:16:03.260 --> 00:16:04.790
Anything but my life!

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:09.460
Stop!

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:17.500
Save me, please!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:20.240
I know who you are.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.840
I'm not here to fight.

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:23.710
I came to stop you.

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:25.910
King Charioce is serious.

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:28.280
Get out of the capital immediately!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:32.250
You're worried for my life?

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:37.860
Well, look how far you've come.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.500
Will continuing to murder humans

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:53.510
really lead you to the future you want for demons?

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:04.720
You fiend!

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:09.620
You have some nerve to see this place
and still say something so stupid.

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:32.810
My God.

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:48.560
Tell me: between the scum I've just killed

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.970
and these harmless, powerless demons...

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.470
who deserves to die?

00:17:57.370 --> 00:18:03.440
Does your chivalry not count the lives of demons?

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:10.950
I don't know where your misunderstanding came from,
but I'm a demon, an enemy of mankind.

00:18:11.280 --> 00:18:16.660
I vow to make you all regret
what you've done to us demons.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:20.430
I will kill as many people as necessary
in order to do that.

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:24.600
You're making a mistake.

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:27.000
No good can come from vengeance.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.040
It will only create more hatred!

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:34.610
Enough with your naive sentimentality.
You're nothing but the king's dog.

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:44.080
You're even lower than other the humans I've killed.

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:47.590
At least they were worth killing.

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:26.120
Damn you filthy humans!

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:39.960
It's okay, it's okay
I cast the usual spell

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:44.060
Stagnation, stagnation
My words and heart are at odds

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:47.970
Default
I've taken all the paint

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:52.540
And mixed up all the colors
Until you're left with me

00:21:52.670 --> 00:21:54.940
So fragile
Yet strong

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:56.940
Close to overflowing
But not spilling

00:21:57.080 --> 00:22:00.810
Because I'm incomplete
I won't amount to much

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:05.050
This is just a good luck charm
I'm not asking for your help

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:09.190
This is just a good luck charm
I was just clinging to you

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:13.790
Let's end it all today

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:18.000
I'm done living this pointless life

00:22:18.130 --> 00:22:22.070
Let's end it all today

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:26.270
I've taken my last pointless breath

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:31.650
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:35.550
I killed the person I was yesterday

00:22:35.680 --> 00:22:39.690
To whom it may concern, see ya and goodbye

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:46.760
A new morning is coming

00:22:59.640 --> 00:23:00.910
I see.

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:04.240
So Kaisar was connected to the rag demon
as I thought.

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:06.110
What shall I do?

00:23:06.250 --> 00:23:08.920
Leave him. Let's see where it leads.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:10.180
Yes, My Lord.

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:14.790
More important is the child who is able
to nullify our armor...

00:23:14.920 --> 00:23:20.630
I believe it could be the child
we lost sight of two years ago.

00:23:21.230 --> 00:23:23.630
So he's still alive.

00:23:23.760 --> 00:23:27.000
Kill the child along with the rag demon.

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:28.940
Do not fail this time.

00:23:29.070 --> 00:23:30.740
Yes, My Lord.

00:23:37.880 --> 00:23:42.720
The rag demon and the holy child, is it?

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:45.390
How interesting.

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:51.690
-This is Nina Drango!
-This is Azazel AKA Aza-nii!

00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:53.760
Young lady,
Songs aren't as simple as you think!

00:23:53.890 --> 00:23:55.960
No, no.
You're nonchalant yourself!

00:23:56.230 --> 00:23:59.770
Next time on Rage of Bahamut: Virgin Soul,
"Close Encounter."

00:24:01.170 --> 00:24:04.000
Baha Soul!!

00:24:04.140 --> 00:24:06.140
Baha Baha Baha Soul

00:24:06.410 --> 00:24:08.980
You better tune in next time.
